{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"28日は、富士急ハイランド特設ステージにて乃木坂46の「の」公開収録でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんと、のぎのの公開収録、\n唯一私、皆勤賞なんだって！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うれしい～ o(^o^)o"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またいつでも呼んでください！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/03/30/9674855/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"富士山キレイだった～！天気良かった～！あつかった～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なにより、応援が嬉しかったです！\nみんなの顔、いつもよりいっぱい見れたよ！\n気付いた？？(﹡ˆ﹀ˆ﹡)えへ\n有難うございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"春休みだからか、色んな人が来てくださってて、\n小さい子供とお母さんが、私のうちわ持って応援してくださってるのが見えて、\nほっこりしたし、嬉しかったです( *´﹀` *)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"※   告知  ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NHKEテレ「Rの法則」\n2015年4月1日（水） 18時55分～19時25分"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"命は美しい アンダーで入ってます。\nよかったら見てください(﹡ˆˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、まいまいお誕生日おめでとう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/03/30/9674855/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/03/30/9674855/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/03/30/9674855/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆヽ(｡･ω･｡)正義"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/03/30/9674855/0000.gif","alt":""}],"sour