,"text":"そんなわたくしは、\nイベントでの懐かしきプリキュアを...(*_*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/5549960/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"キュアリズムさまです！正義っ！＼(^o^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二次元は素晴らしい＼(^o^)／きらぴかっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実は以前、ライヴイベントでキュアメロディさまのコスをして\nめっちゃ恥ずかしかったからもうやらない！って言ってたんですが、\n今回は、ハロウィンってことで特別に\nいのうえ、頑張りました...(^_^;)\n決して毎回こういう格好をしてるとかコスプレが趣味とかではないですっ（笑）\n初めてきてくださった方はびっくりでしたよね...^_^;ワラ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、やっぱりめちゃくちゃ恥ずかしくて恥ずかしくて耐えきれず（笑）\n5部の前で、見せる予定のなかった\n今日普通に着てきた私服に\n着替えちゃいました（笑）（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/5549960/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だってホントに恥ずかしかったんだもん～！（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二次元は二次元だからこそ素晴らしいのです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またこれでもうコスは当分しません...\nからねっ...(*_*)\n今日見れた人はラッキーです！（＾Ｏ＾）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに私服は、WONDERROCKETの！\n実は、生駒ちゃんと色違いのお揃いなの＞_＜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/5549960/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから、ゆみ姉、今日はお疲れさま(*^_^*)\n皆さんも、本当にありがとうございましたm(_ _)m"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とにかく今日も、すごくすごく楽しかったです(*^o^*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/5549960/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感謝することばっかりで、ごめんねだけど..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/5549960/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/5549960/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/5549960/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/5549960/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/5549960/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさゆにゃん ♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/5549960/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お耳 てへぺろ ////"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/5549960/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/5549960/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/5549960/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃんヽ(｡･ω･｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/5549960/0000.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-18803":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっと立候補し続けていた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ロザリオという"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レッツゴー！ポリン姫唯一の男役っ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なぜ選ばれるまでずっと立候補してたかって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年沢村小坊主という男の子を演じて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それ以来男の子役自分にあってる〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2014/06/05/3550040/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って思ってしまったのよ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから今年も男役は絶対やりたくて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ついに！\n昨日選ばれましたヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やった〜ヽ(・∀・)ノヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"純奈と一騎打ちだったよん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よい戦いしたよヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二幕に初日振りにでるんでずっと緊張してましたっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2014/06/05/3550040/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も頑張りますヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へばなっ！⭐︎"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-8442":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっかだよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/14/9228981/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新制服"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/14/9228981/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かわいい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/14/9228981/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"11月14日。ブログ一周年です！\nぱちぱちぱち"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログを書いてもう一年\nたったんだよー！びっくり。\n最初らへんの記事、読んだけど\nだいぶ恥ずかしかった...\nぞわわわわーってなった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/14/9228981/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/14/9228981/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たった一年で自分変わったな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメント数も気づいたら\nだんだん増えてて。\n最初はちょっとでも嬉しかったのに...\nというか、「すげー！」って\n気持ちだった笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また、読んでくれてるかな？とか\nコメントしてくれるのかな？とか\nいろいろ考えるようになりました。\n私なんかのために、\n本当にありがとう><"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここまで更新続けられるのは\nみなさんのおかげです。‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼質問回答タイムだよ！／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/14/9228981/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マンモスフリーマーケット\nには来るの??"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/14/9228981/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"行きます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/14/9228981/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみすぎるー♪るん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/14/9228981/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"冬のルームウェアはどんなん?"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/14/9228981/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度握手会で着ようかな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/14/9228981/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"山登りしたことある？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/14/9228981/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あるよー修学旅行とかで笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/14/9228981/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪長いなー邪魔にならないん？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/14/9228981/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ときどき邪魔になるよー\nでも髪型でかわいくできるなら\n余裕で我慢できるっ\n女の子だもん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/14/9228981/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/14/9228981/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"豆乳、青汁が苦手なんですが\nスムージーなら飲めますかね？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/14/9228981/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も両方とも苦手だったけど\n混ぜたら味が消えて飲みやすく\nなったし、豆乳はすきになったよ！\nなにより健康的だから、\n朝に飲むといいかもー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/14/9228981/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/14/9228981/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鮭の切り身は捌ける様に\nなったかな～⁈"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/14/9228981/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...あ。忘れてた\nママに教えてもらう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/14/9228981/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/14/9228981/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり料理はできる方が\nいいですよね？(男女ともに)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/14/9228981/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......そうだよね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/14/9228981/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/14/9228981/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"料理できるように頑張ります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/14/9228981/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鮭はどのように料理して\n食べるのが好きなのかな？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/14/9228981/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シンプルに焼いて、\n塩とレモンかな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/14/9228981/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかやってみたい\n髪型とかある？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/14/9228981/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか、日常じゃできないやつ。\n**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼ここでなかいさんをはさむよ！／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/14/9228981/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログ一周年ということで、\nリニューアルしたいと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最初の書き出しを無くして、\nもっと自由にしようと思う！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...まぁそれだけなんだけどもね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/14/9228981/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろんな意見聞いた結果です。\nゆるく始まる方が私らしいです！\nたぶん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、書かなくなったからといって\n気持ちは変わりません。\n初心を忘れません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/14/9228981/0014.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一回目で載せたのとまた違う加工の。\nどっち載せるか迷ってた。\n自撮り下手くっそ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもまりかブログを\nよろしくお願いしますします"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/14/9228981/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/14/9228981/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/14/9228981/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}}